WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:09.730
<i>The countless flowers,
enveloped in light…</i>

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:20.290
<i>…gaze at tomorrow
with unwavering eyes.</i>

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:39.350
<i>Everyone wishes for me to be pure…</i>

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:46.810
<i>…but what can I bring
with me to the frayed skies?</i>

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:53.900
<i>What I’ve made my own
by breaking off flowers in bloom…</i>

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:59.580
<i>All such sinful things…</i>

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:07.010
<i>Why did I stop making
promises with the future?</i>

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:14.280
<i>Because even if I try
to run far from all the pain…</i>

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:20.980
<i>…a cold wind rustles
my hair… Don’t you see?</i>

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:28.600
<i>Where can I ever find the answer?</i>

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.330
You said it once yourself.

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:36.490
That I should dismantle a Simoun.

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:40.030
What’s there is nothing but a helix.

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:44.040
The only thing we’re
capable of understanding is…

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:48.040
You can see something!
What… What can you see?

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:58.010
<b>One, and Then Another</b>

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:24.350
What’s that for?

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:27.370
Oh, I’m going to use
these to build a cradle.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.100
A cradle?

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:33.770
Where I grew up, we used to set
out cradles like this every spring.

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:38.420
For those who passed too soon
to at least know a peaceful sleep.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.810
That one’s too thick.

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:51.940
How’s Dominüra?

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:58.410
I don’t know what made
Dominüra break down, but…

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.820
…Rimone,
you should stay by her side.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.320
Why?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:06.540
Of us all, you’re the one
closest to Dominüra.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.300
Aer!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:32.520
Neviril… So nothing happened?

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:35.750
That’s right. Nothing happened.

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:40.360
The enemy’s aerial base has
vanished. Though I don’t know why.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.400
And nothing else happened?

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.610
No.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:46.580
What?

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:51.790
Come on.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:15.600
I want you to tell me.
What did Dominüra see?

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:22.860
I never should have touched
something so sacred after all.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:27.830
I never should have touched it.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:42.010
As you wish,
I’ll never let you touch me again.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.110
So warm…

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.530
You should get some rest today.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:09.780
But with Dominüra in that state…

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:11.540
No…

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.750
What’s going on?

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:22.030
We’ve spotted
the enemy at 11 o’clock.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:23.760
It seems they’re not attacking, but…

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.010
How’s Dominüra?

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:28.510
She still seems quite indisposed…

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:29.930
Excuse me!

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.470
Let’s go, Paraietta.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.650
Let’s go, Neviril.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:52.370
Wait. Neviril is exhausted. She’s in
no condition to go back up there.

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:53.410
But…

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:58.120
Dominüra is currently unable to pray,
so for now you’ll obey my orders.

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:00.830
Orders, she said?

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.630
It sounds like the army.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.340
Fine.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:21.240
It’s a scouting mission.
There’s no need for Neviril to go.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.610
— Kaim?
— Right.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.510
To think Aer would
just back down like that.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.100
It was surprising.

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:52.510
Before, she’d take her up even
if she had to drag her by the arm.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:54.720
I don’t want to see Aer acting like that.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:01.600
The best thing about Aer is
she’s almost aggressively positive.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.980
To see her being tactful…
It’s not like her at all.

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:08.740
Are you jealous?

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:12.720
N-No! That’s not how I feel about Aer!

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:15.280
Hey, Rimone… Where’s Aer?

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.500
I just saw her leaving the ship…

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.040
Leaving, huh?

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.750
I wonder why she did?

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.210
Who knows?

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:33.890
It’s not what you think. I was just
thinking of showering or something.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.050
Nobody’s asking, you know.

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:43.400
Really now.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.300
Sorry.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.920
What are you apologizing for?

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:17.780
You can’t even think of a reason to,
but you’re just doing it anyway?

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.520
I do have a reason.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:24.270
The reason you’re in so much
pain, Neviril… I know it’s my fault.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:32.420
I don’t know why that is, but it’s my
fault… That much I know at least, so…

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:33.780
Don’t flatter yourself!

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:54.510
Floe…

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.510
That was so uncool.

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:02.720
Please forgive me, Sibylla Aurea,
for speaking to you so rudely.

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:15.950
They’re so alike.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:20.280
Amuria… was just like that girl.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:22.240
She was never really looking at me.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:28.080
That’s right…
I finally realized it because of Aer.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.250
In their eyes, I’m…

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:43.810
…no more than a tool to help
them reach greater heights.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:45.890
Neviril…

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:54.690
I think I might have made a mistake.

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:00.780
With you…

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:02.280
Don’t say it.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:05.830
I’m not the person you think I am.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:10.750
If I’m not mistaken about
what you’re about to say…

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:17.010
I’m sure…
that it would make me waver.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.820
You’re exhausted right now.

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.270
You’re not yourself. So please…

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:30.770
I’m sorry.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.900
What have I done?

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.690
I’m sorry, Paraietta…

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.450
I’m sorry!

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:40.490
Neviril…

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.210
Again…

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.430
I’ll go too.

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:56.510
—No. You should…
— But…

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:58.510
Neviril…

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:05.560
I’ll go for heaven’s sake!

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:08.020
The air’s not good here anyway.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.270
The air?

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:12.290
All right, Alty?

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:15.270
I guess, if that’s what Floe wants.

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:18.780
And the other will be flown
by Mamina and Roatreamon.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.490
Roger.

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.090
I don’t know about this…

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:40.090
Aer?

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:43.490
Yun and Kaim haven’t
even come back yet…

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:46.270
And if there’s no attack,
for us to mobilize…

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:47.600
Are you implying I’ve
made the wrong decision?

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.310
I never said that.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:02.700
I can’t always be by your side.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.620
Even so, I can at least protect you.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.540
Neviril…

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:50.990
It’s so quiet…

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:55.000
You’re not going to hang
around the Simouns today?

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:58.080
Well, no.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:03.970
Wanna play hide-and-seek?

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:05.010
Treated like a child…

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:07.020
Well, Aer?

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.260
Sure! Sounds good.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:16.250
All right, Morinas, count to 100.
No cheating, got that?

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:17.790
I know.

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:18.980
Here goes.

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:23.300
One, two, three, four…

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.300
Rimone! Go hide!

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:31.910
…five, six, seven, eight,
nine, ten, eleven, twelve…

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.540
This way!

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:57.230
<i>…as blue as a tear.</i>

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:04.730
<i>As white as a lily…</i>

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:13.120
<i>In the pitch-black darkness…</i>

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:20.130
<i>…the light of a red flame…</i>

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.210
That song…

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:26.260
It’s from Aer’s music box…

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.010
The doorway to a new frontier.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:33.720
For those who seek a land
of peace… The immigrants’ song.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:46.190
Tempus Spatium embraced us, those
whom had no place to call home.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:52.240
Chor Dextra was created
to perform the Emerald Ri Majon…

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:57.670
Its soldiers were recruited for their
willingness to lay down their lives.

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:00.230
But none of that mattered to me.

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:04.500
In return for my death,
Kyuukoku actually needed me.

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:07.680
And I wanted to feel needed.

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:10.840
That was what I’d always… always…

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.840
That’s why…

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:17.040
You’re still needed. Because I…

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:21.230
I want to do the Emerald Ri Majon.
I want to do it with you, Dominüra.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.230
But why?

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:28.230
Because you’re my pair.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.760
Sibylla Paraietta, the rain
is coming down harder.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:51.880
This can’t be good for
your health. Please go inside.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:33.970
What’s the matter?

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.970
Do you need to see Dominüra?

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:42.350
No.

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:56.450
Why am I so indecisive? I’ve got
to do something, or I’ll lose Neviril…

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.600
Another attack.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:34.360
It doesn’t make sense, you know.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:37.750
Shouldn’t we wait for Dominüra
to get back to normal?

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:40.410
Can’t you do anything without
Dominüra instructing you?

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:43.410
This is no time for petty nitpicking.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.840
Petty, you say?

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:48.120
Seriously, at this rate…

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:49.170
Aer!

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:55.880
Pair up with me.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:59.410
You and I will patrol. From now on…

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:00.550
No.

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:01.970
I’m going.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:05.060
Neviril!

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:07.190
Morinas, come with me.

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.280
Me?

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:11.110
Neviril, you can’t go. You’re still…

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:12.950
Please.

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:15.070
Let me go, Paraietta.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:51.980
I’m so…

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.400
…powerless.

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:31.270
What about our game
of hide-and-seek?

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.030
She’s going to die.

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.530
Dominüra…

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:50.540
People who are about to die
have that look in their eyes.

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:53.040
Rimone…

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.310
Dominüra.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:26.000
Dominüra, I want you
to tell me what you think.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.660
What’s your read on this situation?

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:35.920
Dominüra!

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:40.130
Don’t ask me.

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:44.180
Could the judgment of
someone who’s been asleep…

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:47.680
…be less questionable
than your own?

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:04.950
Dominüra.

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:06.740
Another helping please.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.510
The Emerald Ri Majon…

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:26.380
By dismantling a Simoun…

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:30.470
…I think that I’ve seen what
lies beyond its completion.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:36.420
You only think you did, right?

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:39.730
You can’t be sure
unless you really do it.

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:45.570
There’s no other way, is there?

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:51.200
The only thing you’ve ever
been asked to do was to fly high…

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:55.910
To inscribe Ri Majons across
the vast sky. That’s precisely why…

00:21:56.750 --> 00:22:01.500
To be denied this would be the same
as having your own existence denied.

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:08.090
You and I are very much alike.

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:10.390
I chose you.

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:12.640
And you chose me.

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:16.430
If it’s that link between us that
makes a Ri Majon what it is…

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:21.440
I’m going to do it for you.

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:31.990
The Emerald Ri Majon.

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:47.920
<i>It is played by my wounds…
the song of prayer.</i>

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:52.200
<i>Let it ring out over
the grieving universe.</i>

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:59.190
<i>Can we change tomorrow?
Don’t be afraid.</i>

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:06.900
<i>I want to let you know
how my heart’s overflowing.</i>

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:19.750
<i>“I want to get closer to you.”
“I want to feel your pulse.”</i>

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:24.930
<i>I was too defiant,
and I took the long way around.</i>

00:23:24.930 --> 00:23:28.950
<i>The blue moon is swaying silently.</i>

00:23:28.950 --> 00:23:32.760
<i>My true heart’s desire is you.</i>

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:38.220
<i>I can’t reach you.
My tears of pain trickle down.</i>

00:23:38.850 --> 00:23:44.360
<i>Soar away into the sky, song of prayer.</i>

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:47.760
<i>Carrying my love that came too late.</i>

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:53.410
<i>What can I do to change tomorrow?</i>

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:59.620
<i>Just hold on to “now” the way it is…</i>

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:06.670
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:08.340
The Messis has finally…

00:24:08.340 --> 00:24:12.010
…become the target of
Shoukoku’s mid-sized air fleet.

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:16.600
Next time on Simoun…

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:20.020
<b>The Emerald Ri Majon</b>

00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:18.850
The Emerald Ri Majon.
